  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      544.81,
      555.04,
      597.55
    ],
    "text": "Due to low-level atmospheric disturbance persists in the Bay of Bengal vicinity of Sri Lanka, cloudy skies and an increase in rainfall is expected over the island during the next few days.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      600.46,
      554.49,
      635.5
    ],
    "text": "The general public is requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      643.66,
      521.83,
      659.38
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Northern and Southern provinces.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      662.05,
      552.55,
      712.66
    ],
    "text": "Heavy falls about (100-150) mm are likely at some places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, North-Central, Uva and Southern provinces. Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in the other areas of the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      715.45,
      554.81,
      749.14
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      751.93,
      554.72,
      957.0
    ],
    "text": "Misty conditions can be expected at some places in Sabaragamuwa, Central and Uva provinces during the early hours of the morning.",
